      "writtenOn": "2019-04-05T20:20:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Damaged NACK or BUSY will be recognized as junk, and there will be another attempt to get ACK, which is likely to get the same response again.\nHowever, DAMAGED_ACK should not be treated as junk because device believes it sent ACK and waits for the next action. In my experiment, it didn\u0027t work, and put it worse.",
